function libraryExtra(p,s,key,tg){const original=s[key];const record=tajikLibraryExtras[p.id]?.[s.id]?.[key];return tg&&record&&record.original===original&&record.translation.trim()?record.translation:original;}
const localizedLibrary=p=>isTajik()?tajikLibraryProfile(p):null;
const title = (x, kind) => kind === 'name' ? x.transliterationRu : kind === 'dua' ? (localizedDua(x)?.title || x.titleRu) : kind==='caliph' ? (localizedCaliph(x)?.title || x.titleRu) : kind==='lib' ? (localizedLibrary(x)?.title || x.titleRu) : x.titleRu;
function tajikMeaningStatus() {
  return '<p class="attribution" lang="tg" data-tg-meaning-status="draft">Тарҷумаи таҳририи маъно ба тоҷикӣ; санҷиши мустақили забонӣ ва динӣ ҳанӯз анҷом наёфтааст. Матни аслӣ тағйир наёфтааст.</p>';
}
function duaCategoryEntries(id) {
  if(id==='prophets') return entries.filter(x=>(x.categoryIds||[]).includes(id)||['q_7_23','q_27_19'].includes(x.id));
  // Curated morning/evening/daily collections include linked records from other categories.
  const collection = ['morning','evening','daily'].includes(id) && db.library?.collections?.find(c=>c.id===id);
  return collection ? collection.entryIds.map(key=>entries.find(x=>x.id===key)).filter(Boolean) : entries.filter(x=>(x.categoryIds||[]).includes(id));
}
function initData(d, c) {
  db = d; caliphs = c;
  entries = [...new Map([...d.catalog.entries, ...d.catalog_additions.entries].map(x => [x.id, x])).values()];
  library = d.library.items; history = d.history.events; render();
}
function setTab(t) { tab = t; query = ''; filter = 'all'; knowledgeGroup = null; educationTopic = null; duaGroup = null; render(); window.scrollTo(0, 0); }
function toggleReview() {
  if (tab !== 'review') {
    reviewReturnState = {tab, filter, query, knowledgeGroup, educationTopic, duaGroup, scrollY: window.scrollY};
    setTab('review');
    return;
  }
  if (!reviewReturnState) { setTab('home'); return; }
  const previous = reviewReturnState;
  reviewReturnState = null;
  ({tab, filter, query, knowledgeGroup, educationTopic, duaGroup} = previous);
  render();
  requestAnimationFrame(() => window.scrollTo(0, previous.scrollY));
}
function textSearch(x) {
  const t = tajikMeaning(x);
  const n = tajikName(x);
  const h=tajikCaliphProfile(x)||tajikLibraryProfile(x);
  const words = [h?.title,h?.summary,...(h?.sections||[]).flatMap(s=>[s.title,s.text,s.uncertainty,...(s.views||[]).flatMap(v=>[v.title,v.text])]),n?.meaning,n?.explanation,t?.title,t?.meaning,x.titleRu,x.transliterationRu,x.translationRu,x.meaningRu,x.summaryRu,x.arabicText,x.arabicName,...(x.tagsRu || []),...(x.aliasesRu || []),...(x.searchTerms || []),...(x.sections || []).map(s => s.textRu)];
  return words.join(' ').toLocaleLowerCase('ru').includes(query.toLocaleLowerCase('ru'));
}
function item(x, kind, about = false) {
  const subtitle = about
    ? `${statusName(x.reviewStatus || x.status)} · Экспертная проверка: ${x.expertReview ? 'см. сведения' : 'не отмечена'}`
    : kind === 'name' ? (localizedName(x)?.meaning || x.meaningRu) : kind === 'dua' ? (localizedDua(x)?.meaning || x.translationRu) : kind==='caliph' ? (localizedCaliph(x)?.summary || x.summaryRu) : kind==='lib' ? (localizedLibrary(x)?.summary || x.summaryRu) : x.summaryRu;
  return `<button class="item" ${about ? 'data-about' : 'data-open'}="${kind}:${clean(x.id)}">${kind === 'name' ? `<span class="number">${x.number}</span>` : ''}<span class="itembody"><strong>${clean(title(x, kind))}</strong><small>${clean((subtitle || '').slice(0, 140))}${(subtitle || '').length > 140 ? '…' : ''}</small>${isTajik() && !about && ['lib','history','caliph'].includes(kind) && !(kind==='caliph'&&localizedCaliph(x)) && !(kind==='lib'&&localizedLibrary(x)) ? '<small lang="tg" data-tg-card-pending>Ба русӣ · тарҷума ҳанӯз омода нест</small>' : ''}</span>${kind === 'name' ? `<span class="arabicMini" lang="ar" dir="rtl">${clean(x.arabic)}</span>` : '<span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">›</span>'}</button>`;
}
function search() { return `<label class="search"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="search" type="search" aria-label="Найти материал" placeholder="Найти материал…" value="${clean(query)}" autocomplete="off"></label>`; }
function section(t, more) { return `<div class="sectionhead"><h2>${clean(t)}</h2>${more ? `<button data-tab="${clean(more)}">Смотреть всё →</button>` : ''}</div>`; }
